    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_h_s_m_key_provider_adapter" kindref="compound">HSMKeyProviderAdapter</ref> Tests</para>
<para>These tests verify the adapter that bridges <ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_h_s_m_provider" kindref="compound">HSMProvider</ref> with <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_key_provider" kindref="compound">KeyProvider</ref> interface for use with <ref refid="class_field_encryption" kindref="compound">FieldEncryption</ref> in LoRA adapter storage.</para>
<para>Note: These tests require SoftHSM2 to be installed and configured. See <ref refid="test__hsm__provider_8cpp" kindref="compound">test_hsm_provider.cpp</ref> for setup instructions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
